'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Story chapters|story chapter]] in ''[[Escape from Tarkov]]''.

==Description==
{{quote|Turns out BEAR didn't send just regular squads into Tarkov, there were real SOF guys here. I'd like to know more about those units and what exactly they were doing.}}

==Requirements==
Visit one of the following locations:
* Mattress below the "жопа" writing on the second floor of the Scav base on [[Customs]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:EasyMoneyPart1CustomsMap1.png|Scav base location marked on map
File:ZB-013 Building.png|The Scav base
File:Batya Customs Activation Location.png|The wanted mattress
</gallery></li>
* Radome on top of the white queen radar station building on [[Reserve]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:RadarStationGuide.jpg|Radar station marked on map
File:Reserve Showcase 4.png|The radar station
</gallery></li>
* Bunker north of the health resort on [[Shoreline]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:SpaTour5BunkerMap.jpg|Bunker location marked on map
File:The bunker by rock passage.png|The wanted bunker
</gallery></li>
* Mattresses on top of the big rock at the USEC camp on [[Woods]]
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:Batya Woods Activation Map.png|Rock location marked on map
File:Batya Woods Activation Location.png|The wanted mattresses
</gallery></li>

==Objectives==
* Locate the [[Bogatyrs patch|traces]] of the BEAR special squad
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain the [[Bogatyrs patch|Bogatyr squad patch]]
* Learn more about the Bogatyr squad from the traders
* Locate the Ryabina outpost
* Find more [[Hostage evacuation report from Voevoda|information]] about the Bogatyr squad
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain a [[Strelets' amulet|keepsake]] of one of the Bogatyrs
* Locate the Carousel outpost
* Find the Bogatyr squad's [[Strelets' note|personal notes]]
* [[Strelets' note|Learn more]] about Strelets
* [[Taran's personnel file|Learn more]] about Taran
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain a [[Taran's postcard|personal item]] of one of the Bogatyrs
* [[Voevoda's personnel file|Learn more]] about Voevoda
* Find [[Voevoda's thoughts audio tape|Voevoda's personal belongings]]
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain the [[Voevoda's audio recorder (quest item)|squad commander's recorder]]
* Locate the Gnezdo outpost
* [[First piece of code note|Search]] the Gnezdo outpost
* [[BEAR note from the outpost behind Ultra|Figure out]] what happened to the Bogatyr squad
* [[Map with triangulated signal|Figure out]] where the Bogatyr squad got ambushed
* [[Bogatyr squad operations report|Learn more]] about the Bogatyr squad's activities
* [[Moreman's personnel file|Learn more]] about the Bogatyr squad's members
* Locate the ambush spot
* Obtain more information about the Bogatyr squad
* [[Second piece of code note|Inspect]] Moreman's body
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain [[Moreman's phone]]
** (''Optional'') Locate and obtain a [[Moreman's dogtag|dogtag]] of one of the Bogatyrs
* Retrieve more information about the ambush from [[Moreman's phone]]
* Obtain [[Hideout#Modules|Intelligence Center]] level 3
* Contact the Bogatyr squad
* Gain access to [[Lightkeeper]]
* Stay on good terms with [[Lightkeeper]]
* Bring all the Bogatyr squad's items to [[Lightkeeper]]
* Wait for Voevoda to reach out
* Reach the [[Light Machine Guns|Light Machine Guns skill]] level 5
* Reach the [[Assault Rifles|Assault Rifles skill]] level 10
* Reach the [[Stress Resistance|Stress Resistance skill]] level 10
* Reach the [[Strength|Strength skill]] level 15
* Eliminate any 15 targets without dying
* Eliminate 4 PMC operatives without dying
* Contact Voevoda
* Locate the [[Note mentioning Prapor|traces]] of the traitors
** (''Optional'') Investigate the command bunker on [[Reserve]]
** (''Optional'') Investigate the BEAR camp on [[Lighthouse]]
** (''Optional'') Investigate the BEAR camp east of the Ultra mall on [[Interchange]]
* Interrogate [[Prapor]]
* Figure out how the cultists are connected to the General
* Talk to [[Lightkeeper]]
* Wait for [[Lightkeeper]] to prepare the [[Agent network deployment report|documents]] on The Unheard

